00:36:47.740 --> 00:36:49.620
Then I should retreat.

00:36:51.930 --> 00:36:56.540
Robots are so similar to humans that they are likely to kill.

00:37:00.284 --> 00:37:02.284
Thank you for watching.

00:37:09.436 --> 00:37:10.436
See you later!

00:37:10.908 --> 00:37:12.908
Thank you for watching.

00:37:38.412 --> 00:37:41.532
I'm just getting rid of the illegal robots!

00:37:41.580 --> 00:37:42.580
Hehehehe

00:37:46.988 --> 00:37:50.148
Why are you chasing me like this?

00:38:04.320 --> 00:38:09.160
Don't get in my way.

00:38:09.860 --> 00:38:11.400
I'm still here.

00:38:11.820 --> 00:38:13.050
I'm SARD.

00:38:30.090 --> 00:38:30.670
What's wrong with my legs?

00:38:33.080 --> 00:38:37.700
What's wrong with you?

00:38:37.900 --> 00:38:38.940
You're such a fool.

00:38:39.600 --> 00:38:41.140
You're the one who's making a mistake.

00:38:42.300 --> 00:38:46.100
I'm going to replace you with a cyborg.

00:39:05.560 --> 00:39:05.900
What?

00:39:08.840 --> 00:39:24.180
The God of Friendship.

00:39:24.180 --> 00:39:26.430
Let me tell you.

00:39:26.750 --> 00:39:28.430
There's no God here.

00:39:36.720 --> 00:39:39.500
Jean-Claude, why can't I forgive you?

00:39:39.780 --> 00:39:42.300
Why are you on the side of robots?

00:39:42.760 --> 00:39:45.740
Why do you believe in the existence of S.W.A.R.D?

00:39:45.900 --> 00:39:47.750
I'll tell you.

00:39:47.930 --> 00:39:53.880
Because my power, my destiny, goes on like this!

00:39:54.200 --> 00:39:54.420
Fine.

00:40:00.700 --> 00:40:03.420
That's my own power!

00:40:04.640 --> 00:40:06.520
What did you say!?

00:40:06.520 --> 00:40:06.900
Angel!

00:40:08.050 --> 00:40:10.660
Why!?

00:40:10.660 --> 00:40:12.820
My ideals don't have your name on them!

00:40:40.460 --> 00:40:43.550
Third's proof, Third's power!

00:41:33.580 --> 00:41:33.800
Yes.

00:41:33.840 --> 00:41:35.980
That's right.

00:41:36.180 --> 00:41:36.460
I'm a monster.

00:41:37.610 --> 00:41:39.490
What should I do?

00:41:39.510 --> 00:41:40.110
Should I destroy it?

00:41:40.430 --> 00:41:41.310
What is it?

00:41:41.490 --> 00:41:43.180
If it's the source of the evil,

00:41:43.180 --> 00:41:44.530
if it's a social drug,

00:41:45.030 --> 00:41:46.970
then why did humans create us?

00:41:48.170 --> 00:41:56.780
Don't kill me!

00:41:57.080 --> 00:41:59.160
You have to do it yourself.

00:42:00.220 --> 00:42:01.020
Amite-s!

00:42:01.756 --> 00:42:03.116
You're a police officer, right?

00:42:05.916 --> 00:42:07.916
Robots are not human enemies.

00:42:08.156 --> 00:42:08.916
It's the other way around.

00:42:09.980 --> 00:42:10.780
Isn't that right?

00:42:35.260 --> 00:42:45.270
My body... I'm not a human!

00:42:45.810 --> 00:42:51.540
No matter what they do to me, I can still stand up and talk...

00:42:51.540 --> 00:42:58.520
Comitees!

00:43:15.804 --> 00:43:16.664
Mr. Ami!

00:43:28.028 --> 00:43:28.708
Shoto?

00:43:29.180 --> 00:43:29.980
Hang in there!

00:43:30.060 --> 00:43:38.480
Hey, hey, Mitenshi!

00:43:39.070 --> 00:43:40.480
Hey, get a hold of yourself!

00:43:40.900 --> 00:43:42.130
Open your eyes!

00:43:42.470 --> 00:43:53.020
But...

00:44:02.076 --> 00:44:04.076
I don't understand anything!

00:44:04.252 --> 00:44:06.252
You don't know anything about me!

00:44:12.124 --> 00:44:13.124
Goodbye, Nara.

00:45:01.020 --> 00:45:08.940
At night, I look down from the emergency exit

00:45:08.940 --> 00:45:10.960
At the scrap factory

00:45:12.160 --> 00:45:20.450
A kitten comes out from the side

00:45:32.400 --> 00:45:33.010
Cause then

00:46:00.284 --> 00:46:01.604
I have a feeling

00:46:03.772 --> 00:46:05.272
I wonder when

00:47:04.860 --> 00:47:05.600
I'm the third.

00:47:05.780 --> 00:47:07.260
But I have a feeling.

00:47:07.940 --> 00:47:08.690
A memory.

00:47:09.010 --> 00:47:10.420
Where are the third ones?

00:47:10.960 --> 00:47:13.100
Please, answer me!

00:47:13.100 --> 00:47:14.880
Amite-

00:47:15.000 --> 00:47:17.950
Page 3, Episode 2, Fresh and Storm.

00:47:18.210 --> 00:47:20.380
Ross, don't follow me.
